Press the dig button to pick up or strike things.=Нажмите кнопку «копать», чтобы поднять или ударить предметы.
Press the place button to put things down.=Нажмите кнопку «положить», чтобы положить вещи.
Press the use button to activate items and nodes.@n @n This is E by default on PC, AUX1 or sprint on mobile.=Нажмите кнопку «Использовать», чтобы активировать предметы и узлы.@n @nПо умолчанию это E на ПК, AUX1 или sprint на мобильных устройствах.
Press the zoom key to see the name of what you're looking at. @n This is Z by default on PC, and the binoculars or magnifying lens on mobile.=Нажмите кнопку увеличения, чтобы увидеть название того, на что вы смотрите.@nПо умолчанию это Z на ПК, а на мобильных - бинокль или увеличительная линза.
Double-tap sneak to crouch and get through small spaces.@n@nIf server lag makes this hard, you can use the /crouch command, or install exile_csm, the client-side mod to handle controls locally.=Дважды нажмите кнопку sneak, чтобы приседать и пробираться через небольшие пространства.@n@nЕсли из-за задержки сервера это сложно сделать, вы можете использовать команду /crouch или установить exile_csm, мод на стороне клиента для локального управления.
Loss of energy affects move and jump rate.=
Drop a torch to see what's below.=
A shelter needs something solid over your head.@nOnce completed, this roof will shield against hot or cold weather.=
Build a bed in a sheltered place to restore energy.@nBetter beds restore it faster.@n@n=
This is a very poor bed and shelter.=
Fires create hot air, which will drift away unless contained.@nIt is normally invisible, but is shown here.=
Keep fires away from water, muddy ground, and anything that can catch on fire.=
Dig this plant and right click with an empty hand to open the crafting menu. Craft sticks from the plants.=
Look in the tools tab and craft a digging stick, which can break the clay blocking the door.=
A flat surface to work on allows more crafts.@nCraft an adze to remove the log that's in the way.=
More crafts come with tools and stations.@nCraft iron ingots for an iron pick to cut the stone covering the exit.=
You'll need a ladder here. Put down your adze to make sticks from a log, then combine with the fiber from the pot. The ladder is made in the weaving tab of hand crafting.=
Some crafts need to be done by cooking with fire or soaking things under a liquid.=
Exile is a challenging game. Failure is normal, and a part of the fun!=
Can you jump the gap?=
Do you want to try again?=
What if you tried a different method?=
You might not succeed at what you were planning, but you might find another way!=
New players will typically die several times before learning how to survive. Try to enjoy your character's adventure, even if it ends in disaster.=
Be prepared to experiment, explore, and try, try again!=
Good Luck! The tutorial is over now. You are on your own.=
